{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1CH",
  "chapter": 2,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Israel; Reuben, Simeon, Levi, and Judah, Issachar, and Zebulun,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Dan, Joseph, and Benjamin, Naphtali, Gad, and Asher.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Judah; Er, and Onan, and Shelah: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " three were born to him of the daughter of Shua the Canaanitess. And Er, the first-born of Judah, was evil in the sight of the LORD; and he slew him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Tamar his daughter-in-law bore him Pharez and Zerah. All the sons of Judah ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Pharez; Hezron, and Hamul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Zerah; Zimri, and Ethan, and Heman, and Calcol, and Dara: five of them in all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Carmi; Achar, the troubler of Israel, who transgressed in the thing accursed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Ethan; Azariah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons also of Hezron, that were born to him; Jerahmeel, and Ram, and Chelubai.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Ram begat Amminadab; and Amminadab begat Nahshon, prince of the children of Judah;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Nahshon begat Salma, and Salma begat Boaz,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Boaz begat Obed, and Obed begat Jesse,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jesse begat his first-born Eliab, and Abinadab the second, and Shimma the third,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nethaneel the fourth, Raddai the fifth,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ozem the sixth, David the seventh:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whose sisters ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Zeruiah, and Abigail. And the sons of Zeruiah; Abishai, and Joab, and Asahel, three.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abigail bore Amasa: and the father of Amasa ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Jether the Ishmaelite.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Caleb the son of Hezron begat ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "children",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of Azubah ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wife, and of Jerioth: her sons ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " these; Jesher, and Shobab, and Ardon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when Azubah was dead, Caleb took to him Ephrath, who bore to him Hur,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Hur begat Uri, and Uri begat Bezaleel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And afterward Hezron went in to the daughter of Machir the father of Gilead, whom he married when he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sixty years old; and she bore him Segub.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Segub begat Jair, who had three and twenty cities in the land of Gilead.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he took Geshur, and Aram, with the towns of Jair, from them, with Kenath and its towns, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sixty cities. All these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "belonged to",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Machir, the father of Gilead.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And after that Hezron was dead in Caleb-ephratah, then Abiah Hezron's wife bore him Ashur the father of Tekoa.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Jerahmeel the first-born of Hezron were, Ram the first-born, and Bunah, and Oren, and Ozem, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahijah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jerahmeel had also another wife, whose name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Atarah; she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the mother of Onam.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Ram the first-born of Jerahmeel were, Maaz, and Jamin, and Eker.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Onam were, Shammai, and Jada. And the sons of Shammai; Nadab, and Abishur.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the name of the wife of Abishur ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Abihail; and she bore him Ahban, and Molid.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Nadab; Seled, and Appaim: but Seled died without children.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Appaim; Ishi. And the sons of Ishi; Sheshan. And the children of Sheshan; Ahlai.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Jada the brother of Shammai; Jether, and Jonathan: and Jether died without children.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Jonathan; Peleth, and Zaza. These were the sons of Jerahmeel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now Sheshan had no sons, but daughters. And Sheshan had a servant, an Egyptian, whose name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Jarha.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Sheshan gave his daughter to Jarha his servant for a wife; and she bore him Attai.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Attai begat Nathan, and Nathan begat Zabad,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Zabad begat Ephlal, and Ephlal begat Obed,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Obed begat Jehu, and Jehu begat Azariah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Azariah begat Helez, and Helez begat Eleasah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Eleasah begat Sisamai, and Sisamai begat Shallum,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.41",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.41",
      "verse": 41,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Shallum begat Jekamiah, and Jekamiah begat Elishama.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.42",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.42",
      "verse": 42,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now the sons of Caleb the brother of Jerahmeel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", Mesha his first-born, who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the father of Ziph; and the sons of Mareshah the father of Hebron.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.43",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.43",
      "verse": 43,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Hebron; Korah, and Tappuah, and Rekem, and Shema.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.44",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.44",
      "verse": 44,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Shema begat Raham, the father of Jorkoam: and Rekem begat Shammai.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.45",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.45",
      "verse": 45,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the son of Shammai ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Maon: and Maon ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the father of Beth-zur.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.46",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.46",
      "verse": 46,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Ephah, Caleb's concubine, bore Haran, and Moza, and Gazez: and Haran begat Gazez.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.47",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.47",
      "verse": 47,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Jahdai; Regem, and Jotham, and Geshan, and Pelet, and Ephah, and Shaaph.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.48",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.48",
      "verse": 48,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Maachah, Caleb's concubine, bore Sheber, and Tirhanah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.49",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.49",
      "verse": 49,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "She bore also Shaaph the father of Madmannah, Sheva the father of Machbenah, and the father of Gibea: and the daughter of Caleb ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Achsah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.50",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.50",
      "verse": 50,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These were the sons of Caleb the son of Hur, the first-born of Ephratah; Shobal the father of Kirjath-jearim,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.51",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.51",
      "verse": 51,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Salma the father of Beth-lehem, Hareph the father of Beth-gader.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.52",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.52",
      "verse": 52,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Shobal the father of Kirjath-jearim had sons; Haroeh, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " half of the Manahethites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.53",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.53",
      "verse": 53,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the families of Kirjath-jearim; the Ithrites, and the Puhites, and the Shumathites, and the Mishraites; of them came the Zereathites, and the Eshtaulites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.54",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.54",
      "verse": 54,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Salma; Beth-lehem, and the Netophathites, Ataroth, the house of Joab, and half of the Menahethites, the Zorites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.2.55",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.2.55",
      "verse": 55,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the families of the scribes who dwelt at Jabez; the Tirathites, the Shimeathites, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
